\title{Continuum comparison of the cochain calculus}
\date{2026-11-15}

\p{How does the counting calculus on a cubical torus compare
with Whitney forms on a smooth triangulation?}

\p{The cited bounds apply to a compact oriented Riemannian
manifold with a smooth triangulation. A flat torus, with any
smooth triangulation, is one such manifold. The cubical complex
of \ref{fdip-00OK} is a different complex, and the comparison
below keeps the two pairings separate.}

